### SEC-01: SQL Injection payload in productId - should not bypass DB query
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user-1/items
Authorization: Bearer user-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "productId": "product-1' OR '1'='1",
  "quantity": 1
}

### SEC-02: IDOR - user-1 tries to read user-2 cart
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user-2/items
Authorization: Bearer user-1
Accept: application/json

### SEC-03: Missing authentication - should be 401/403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/user-1/items
Accept: application/json

### SEC-04: Stored XSS payload in checkout shippingAddress - should be rejected or encoded
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/user-1
Authorization: Bearer user-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "items": [
    { "userId": "user-1", "productId": "product-1", "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "",
  "shippingFee": 15000,
  "shippingAddress": "<script>alert('xss')</script>",
  "paymentMethod": "COD"
}
